Hi everyone!

These are the changes and bug fixes of this update.


Fixed Music and SFX volume;
Bounced Kunais (the knife that deals more damage than the shuriken) don't get destroyed if hit an enemy anymore;
Added cancel when you completed the password by pressing cancel button;
Replaced some items, so changing sub-weapons to pick coins is not mandatory in certain cases anymore;
Fixed Mother Alien attack patterns.
Shuriken Shield now is more effective on blocking projectiles and against small/near death enemies;
Fixed some minor bugs.


Thanks for your ever support, my work is for you!

Kind regards,
Alysson L. Neto
